;; Diagnostic corpus case: PR #452 -- hash-keys on a non-hash-table operand
;; raises a guard-catchable runtime error instead of unpackPtr-ing a
;; non-pointer tagged value and SIGSEGVing. Same shape as
;; tests/v1_2_edge_cases/type_safety_test.esk's
;; `(guard (exn (#t #t)) (hash-keys 42) #f)` regression pin.

(display (guard (exn (#t "caught-452")) (hash-keys 42)))
(newline)
